      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779018721263,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A set of vectors v1, v2,..., vn is linearly dependent if there exist\nconstants c1, c2,...,cn, not all zero, such that c1v1 + c2v2 +... + cnvn = 0.\nExample The vectors v1 = (1, 0) and v2 = (2, 0) are linearly\ndependent because 2v1  v2 = 0.",
      "fontSize": 111,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A set of vectors v1, v2,..., vn is linearly dependent if there exist\nconstants c1, c2,...,cn, not all zero, such that c1v1 + c2v2 +... + cnvn = 0.\nExample The vectors v1 = (1, 0) and v2 = (2, 0) are linearly\ndependent because 2v1  v2 = 0.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
